We need to keep the existing defending drones in place for Field_1 and Field_8, and the drone in Field_40 will move with 2 assigned to it.

### Group Assignments
- Drones already protecting a field will remain.  
- All idle drones will be used to shore up the high-threat fields.

By following this plan, we strategically address the most pressing threats.

